\"Reject if the product has an issue. Once accepted, return/cancellation isn’t allowed.\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"subscription_svc_config\" : {\n      \"noOrders\" : {\n        \"title\" : \"No orders yet\",\n        \"description\" : \"Order by 11:59 PM & get free delivery next day\"\n      },\n      \"topUpBanner\" : {\n        \"global\" : 20,\n        \"enabled\" : true,\n        \"endTime\" : \"23:59\",\n        \"dayLevel\" : 5,\n        \"startTime\" : \"19:00\"\n      },\n      \"topup_bs_new\" : {\n        \"global\" : 3,\n        \"enabled\" : true,\n        \"dayLevel\" : 1,\n        \"lottieURL\" : \"https://bigbasket.com/media/uploads/2026/1/9/top-up-new-users.png\",\n        \"cooldownDays\" : 7\n      },\n      \"lowWalletNudge\" : {\n        \"heading\" : \"Subscription will get paused\",\n        \"iconUrl\" : \"https://www.bbassets.com/media/uploads/2026/6/29/wallet-01_(1).png\",\n        \"description\" : \"Add money to wallet\",\n        \"primaryButtonText\" : \"Add money\"\n      },\n      \"lowWalletPopup\" : {\n        \"heading\" : \"Insufficient bbWallet balance\",\n        \"iconUrl\" : \"https://bigbasket.com/media/uploads /2025/7/15/insufficient_lottie_home.json\",\n        \"description\" : \"Add money to your bbWallet for uninterrupted subscription.\",\n        \"primaryButtonText\" : \"Add money\",\n        \"secondaryButtonText\" : \"Not now\"\n      },\n      \"topUpCoachmark\" : {\n        \"CTA\" : \"Try 7 AM delivery\",\n        \"global\" : 3,\n        \"content\" : [ ],\n        \"enabled\" : true,\n        \"dayLevel\" : 1,\n        \"imageUrl\" : \"https://bigbasket.com/media/uploads/2026/1/9/topup-new-users-basket.png\",\n        \"cooldownDays\" : 7\n      },\n      \"autoSetupConfig\" : {\n        \"heading\" : \"Auto-recharge\",\n        \"chipText\" : \"New\",\n        \"description\" : \"Never run out of balance for your deliveries! \",\n        \"primaryButtonText\" : \"Set up now\"\n      },\n      \"faq_bottomsheet\" : {\n        \"faq\" : {\n          \"items\" : [ {\n            \"faq_answer\" : \"No, you don’t need to pay any delivery charge for your bbDaily subscription orders .\",\n            \"faq_question\" : \"Are there any charges applicable to my bbDaily orders?\"\n          }, {\n            \"faq_answer\" : \"The amount for your subscription orders will be automatically used from your bbWallet balance. You need to ensure you’ve sufficient balance in your bbWallet for your upcoming order to continue your subscription. Rest assured, you’ll be notified before if your wallet balance is low.\",\n            \"faq_question\" : \"How do I pay for my bbDaily subscription order?\"\n          }, {\n            \"faq_answer\" : \"Yes, you can check the subscription availability in your area by entering your location details in the app.\",\n            \"faq_question\" : \"Can I check the delivery for subscription in my area?\"\n          }, {\n            \"faq_answer\" : \"No, bbDaily subscriptions do not have any minimum order value. You can subscribe to your daily needs as per your convenience.\",\n            \"faq_question\" : \"Is there any minimum order value?\"\n          }, {\n            \"faq_answer\" : \"Any amount deducted for the cancelled bbDaily order will be refunded to your bbWallet instantly.\",\n            \"faq_question\" : \"How do I get a refund for a cancelled order?\"\n          }, {\n            \"faq_answer\" : \"In case, wrong or damaged product is delivered to you, please reach out to our customer support for quick resolution.\",\n            \"faq_question\" : \"What if I receive damaged or wrong product?\"\n          }, {\n            \"faq_answer\" : \"If you find out that your delivered order has some missing products, please reach out to our customer support for quick resolution.\",\n            \"faq_question\" : \"What should I do if my products are missing?\"\n          }, {\n            \"faq_answer\" : \"Go to your Account > Subscription. Select the product and you will get the options to pause the subscription or skip the upcoming order.\",\n            \"faq_question\" : \"How can I pause my subscription or skip my upcoming order?\"\n          }, {\n            \"faq_answer\" : \"Go to your Account > Subscription. Select the product you want to make the modifications to, and you will get the options to change quantity and frequency.\",\n            \"faq_question\" : \"How can I modify the delivery frequency or quantity?\"\n          } ],\n          \"heading\" : \"FAQ\",\n          \"stickyButtonText\" : \"Explore\",\n          \"start_subscription_button_text\" : \"Start subscription\"\n        },\n        \"checklist\" : {\n          \"heading\" : \"What is 'bbDaily by 7AM' delivery?\"\n        },\n        \"subscribe_title\" : \"What is bbDaily?\",\n        \"subscription_desc\" : \"A smarter way to get your daily essentials delivered fresh by 7 AM at additional 5% cashback \",\n        \"checklist_header_image_url\" : \"https://bigbasket.com/media/uploads/2026/1/16/top-up-faq-banner.png\",\n        \"subscribe_header_image_url\" : \"https://www.bbassets.com/media/uploads/2026/5/21/FAQ-placeholder-bottomsheet-new-s3.png\"\n      },\n      \"filterCoachmark\" : {\n        \"CTA\" : \"Got it\",\n        \"global\" : 1,\n        \"enabled\" : true,\n        \"dayLevel\" : 1,\n        \"cooldownDays\" : 10,\n        \"filterCoachmarkText\" : \"Filter products available for subscription here\",\n        \"filterCoachmarkImageUrl\" : \"https://www.bbassets.com/media/uploads/coachmarks/subscribe.png\",\n        \"filterAppliedCoachmarkText\" : \"Subscription filter applied\",\n        \"filterCoachmarkBGLottieURL\" : \"https://bigbasket.com/media/uploads/2026/1/7/subscription-filter-visibility-coachmark.png\",\n        \"filterAppliedCoachmarkBGLottieURL\" : \"https://bigbasket.com/media/uploads/2026/1/7/subscription-filter-coachmark.png\"\n      },\n      \"lowWalletConfig\" : {\n      